hiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p134","quote":"哀公大父雍，晉昭公少子也，號爲戴子。戴子生忌。忌善知伯，蚤死，故知伯欲盡并晉，未敢，乃立忌子驕爲君。當是時，晉國政皆決知伯，晉哀公不得有所制。知伯遂有范、中行地，最彊。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"晉昭公少子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示親屬或生育敘事；不由繼位補父子，不補闕代。母、女弟、庶孫等依原文；人物暫同指及不同篇主張仍待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji033-132","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q","surfaces":["晉昭公"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-032-qi","c-shiji-033-lu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p067","quote":"九年，景公使晏嬰之晉，與叔向私語曰：「齊政卒歸田氏。田氏雖無大德，以公權私，有德於民，民愛之。」十二年，景公如晉，見平公，欲與伐燕。十八年，公復如晉，見昭公。二十六年，獵魯郊，因入魯，與晏嬰俱問魯禮。三十一年，魯昭公辟季氏難，奔齊。齊欲以千社封之，子家止昭公，昭公乃請齊伐魯，取鄆以居昭公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p073","quote":"昭公三年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之，魯恥焉。四年，楚靈王會諸矦於申，昭公稱病不往。七年，季武子卒。八年，楚靈王就章華臺，召昭公。昭公往賀，賜昭公寶器；已而悔，復詐取之。十二年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之。十三年，楚公子棄疾弒其君靈王，代立。十五年，朝晉，晉留之葬晉昭公，魯恥之。二十年，齊景公與晏子狩竟，因入魯問禮。二十一年，朝晉至河，晉謝還之。"}],"rationale":"按文公以後立嗣、昭公出奔、夾谷會盟、徵百牢與魯君世系的具體事件及國別暫定異稱，後期同爵稱不與先君混同。身份、匿名指代與數位疑讀待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji039-105","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q","surfaces":["昭公","昭公夷"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-032-qi","c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p067","quote":"九年，景公使晏嬰之晉，與叔向私語曰：「齊政卒歸田氏。田氏雖無大德，以公權私，有德於民，民愛之。」十二年，景公如晉，見平公，欲與伐燕。十八年，公復如晉，見昭公。二十六年，獵魯郊，因入魯，與晏嬰俱問魯禮。三十一年，魯昭公辟季氏難，奔齊。齊欲以千社封之，子家止昭公，昭公乃請齊伐魯，取鄆以居昭公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p123","quote":"二十二年，伐燕。二十六年，平公卒，子昭公夷立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p124","quote":"昭公六年卒。六卿彊，公室卑。子頃公去疾立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p133","quote":"出公十七年，知伯與趙、韓、魏共分范、中行地以爲邑。出公怒，告齊、魯，欲以伐四卿。四卿恐，遂反攻出公。出公奔齊，道死。故知伯乃立昭公曾孫驕爲晉君，是爲哀公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p134","quote":"哀公大父雍，晉昭公少子也，號爲戴子。戴子生忌。忌善知伯，蚤死，故知伯欲盡并晉，未敢，乃立忌子驕爲君。當是時，晉國政皆決知伯，晉哀公不得有所制。知伯遂有范、中行地，最彊。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p067","text":"九年，景公使晏嬰之晉，與叔向私語曰：「齊政卒歸田氏。田氏雖無大德，以公權私，有德於民，民愛之。」十二年，景公如晉，見平公，欲與伐燕。十八年，公復如晉，見昭公。二十六年，獵魯郊，因入魯，與晏嬰俱問魯禮。三十一年，魯昭公辟季氏難，奔齊。齊欲以千社封之，子家止昭公，昭公乃請齊伐魯，取鄆以居昭公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"晏嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"jcn_rp4_qap","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"叔向","kind":"person","person_id":"edm_4zm_yh1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"0ad_dbw_97q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"晏嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"jcn_rp4_qap","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0105","start":105,"end":108,"surface":"魯昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、族稱或未定指代；齊秉意茲等疑讀待版本校勘，不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"子家","kind":"person","person_id":"2vz_w08_06z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m067-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p073","text":"昭公三年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之，魯恥焉。四年，楚靈王會諸矦於申，昭公稱病不往。七年，季武子卒。八年，楚靈王就章華臺，召昭公。昭公往賀，賜昭公寶器；已而悔，復詐取之。十二年，朝晉至河，晉平公謝還之。十三年，楚公子棄疾弒其君靈王，代立。十五年，朝晉，晉留之葬晉昭公，魯恥之。二十年，齊景公與晏子狩竟，因入魯問禮。二十一年，朝晉至河，晉謝還之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"晉平公","kind":"person","person_id":"0p8_ug5_eja","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"楚靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"glu_u6e_lf4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"季武子","kind":"person","person_id":"nvt_gxa_pdo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"楚靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"glu_u6e_lf4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"cp2_vf3_igr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m073-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"c